#: .\users\templates\users\login.html:5
msgid "登入 / 註冊"
msgstr "Login / Register"

#: .\users\templates\users\login.html:19
msgid "流程提醒"
msgstr "Process Reminders"

#: .\users\templates\users\login.html:20
msgid ""
"系統會依你的國籍、身分別與目前狀態，自動生成簽證申請、入臺前與入臺後的重要任"
"務，並以進度方式提醒你一步一步完成。"
msgstr ""
"The system automatically generates important tasks for visa application, pre-"
"arrival, and post-arrival based on your nationality, identity type, and "
"current status, and reminds you step by step through progress tracking."

#: .\users\templates\users\login.html:38
msgid "資訊管理"
msgstr "Information Management"

#: .\users\templates\users\login.html:39
msgid ""
"把簽證、居留證、健保、住宿與入學報到資訊整合成一站式頁面，讓學生更容易找到正"
"確資料，不再被零散資訊搞混。"
msgstr ""
"It integrates visa, ARC, health insurance, accommodation, and school "
"registration information into a one-stop page, helping students find correct "
"information more easily without being confused by scattered sources."

#: .\users\templates\users\login.html:62
msgid ""
"當你不知道第一步該做什麼、文件要準備哪些，或是不知道該問誰時，都可以直接透過 "
"AI 小幫手快速獲得協助。"
msgstr ""
"When you do not know what to do first, which documents to prepare, or who to "
"ask, you can get quick help directly through the AI assistant."

#: .\users\templates\users\login.html:78
msgid "顯示第一張介紹"
msgstr "Show the first introduction slide"

#: .\users\templates\users\login.html:79
