#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:4
#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:33
msgid "填寫個人資料"
msgstr "Fill in Profile Information"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:20
msgid "填寫資料"
msgstr "Fill in Information"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:25
msgid "開始使用"
msgstr "Start Using"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:34
msgid ""
"這些資訊將用於生成您的個人化來臺流程，請確實填寫以獲得最準確的步驟提示。"
msgstr ""
"This information will be used to generate your personalized study-in-Taiwan "
"process. Please fill it in accurately to receive the most suitable step-by-"
"step guidance."

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:45
msgid "請選擇國籍"
msgstr "Please select your nationality"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:72
msgid "請選擇身份別"
msgstr "Please select your identity type"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:77
msgid "身份別將影響您的流程任務內容"
msgstr "Your identity type will affect the content of your process tasks"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:88
msgid "準備來臺流程"
msgstr "Preparing for the Taiwan arrival process"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:96
msgid "辦理簽證等手續"
msgstr "Handling visa and related procedures"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:104
msgid "辦理 ARC 等後續"
msgstr "Handling ARC and follow-up procedures"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:112
msgid "時間規劃"
msgstr "Time Planning"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:118
msgid "非必填"
msgstr "Optional"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:131
msgid "儲存資料並開始使用"
msgstr "Save Information and Start Using"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:140
msgid "帳號資料預覽"
msgstr "Account Information Preview"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:146
msgid "國籍未選"
msgstr "Nationality not selected"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:147
msgid "身份別未選"
msgstr "Identity type not selected"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:148
msgid "狀態未選"
msgstr "Status not selected"

#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:171
msgid ""
"\n"
"            資料儲存後，系統將根據您的 <b>國籍</b>、<b>身份別</b> 與\n"
"            <b>入學狀態</b> 自動生成個人化任務流程。\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            After the information is saved, the system will automatically "
"generate a personalized task process based on your <b>nationality</b>, "
"<b>identity type</b>, and\n"
"            <b>admission status</b>.\n"
"            "

#: .\users\templates\users\reset_password.html:4
#: .\users\templates\users\reset_password.html:11
msgid "重設密碼"
msgstr "Reset Password"

#: .\users\templates\users\reset_password.html:12
msgid "請輸入您的新密碼。"
msgstr "Please enter your new password."

#: .\users\templates\users\reset_password.html:21
msgid "至少 8 字元"
msgstr "At least 8 characters"

#: .\users\templates\users\reset_password.html:35
msgid "確認重設密碼"
msgstr "Confirm Password Reset"

#: .\users\templates\users\reset_password.html:55
msgid "兩次密碼不一致"
msgstr "The two passwords do not match"

#: .\users\templates\users\reset_password.html:70
msgid "密碼重設成功，請重新登入"
msgstr "Password reset successful. Please log in again."

#: .\users\templates\users\reset_password.html:75
msgid "重設失敗，連結可能已過期"
msgstr "Reset failed. The link may have expired."

#~ msgid "回到儀表板"
#~ msgstr "Back to Dashboard"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "依照你的個人資料，協助整理入境前、入境後、簽證、居留證、健保與生活資訊。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Based on your profile, it helps organize pre-arrival, post-arrival, visa, "
#~ "ARC, health insurance, and daily life information."

#~ msgid "你好，"
#~ msgstr "Hello, "

#~ msgid "我的帳戶"
#~ msgstr "My Account"

msgid "台灣的便利商店可以繳費、取貨、影印，也能買到很多生活用品。"
msgstr "Convenience stores in Taiwan can be used for bill payment, parcel pickup, printing, and buying many daily necessities."

msgid "在台灣搭捷運、公車，常會使用悠遊卡或一卡通。"
msgstr "In Taiwan, people often use an EasyCard or iPASS to take the MRT and buses."

msgid "台灣很多學校都有國際事務處，可以協助境外生處理入學與生活問題。"
msgstr "Many schools in Taiwan have an international affairs office that helps international students with admission and daily life issues."

msgid "在台灣租屋前，建議先確認租金、押金、水電費和租約期限。"
msgstr "Before renting in Taiwan, check the rent, deposit, utility fees, and lease period."

msgid "台灣看醫生時，如果已加入健保，通常醫療費用會比自費便宜。"
msgstr "When seeing a doctor in Taiwan, medical costs are usually lower if you are enrolled in National Health Insurance."

msgid "台灣垃圾車通常會播放音樂提醒居民倒垃圾，不同地區時間不同。"
msgstr "Garbage trucks in Taiwan often play music to remind residents to take out trash. The schedule differs by area."

msgid "台灣夏天較熱且潮濕，外出可以準備水壺、防曬和雨具。"
msgstr "Taiwan’s summers are hot and humid, so it is useful to carry water, sun protection, and rain gear."

msgid "如果在台灣變更住址，部分證件或學校資料可能需要一起更新。"
msgstr "If you change your address in Taiwan, some documents or school records may need to be updated."

msgid "台灣校園常用 Email 或學校系統公告重要資訊，建議定期查看。"
msgstr "Taiwanese schools often use email or school systems to announce important information, so check them regularly."

msgid "來台後辦理手機門號時，通常需要護照、居留證或其他身分文件。"
msgstr "When applying for a mobile number after arriving in Taiwan, you usually need a passport, ARC, or other identity documents."
